  "name": "Give of Thyself",
  "type": "ability",
  "img": "icons/svg/book.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Choose one willing allied target with levels of an Adversarial Condition within 5ft of you. They immediately make X Trait Checks against levels of the Condition, where X is a number up to half your Proficiency, rounded up. You may choose for them to make more Trait Checks than they have levels of the Condition. They remove a level of the Condition for each successful trait check made. For each Trait Check they fail, you gain 1 Fatigue.</p>",
